  "Description": {
    "Cost": 5020531,
    "UIName": "Phantom",
    "Id": "chassisdef_phantom_PTM-J",
    "Name": "Phantom",
    "Details": "The J configuration is the only loadout of the Phantom to mount a Supercharger. This increased boost in movement speed, combined with the three ER Medium Lasers and single Improved Heavy Medium Laser means the 'Mech can strafe enemies repeatedly without much risk if piloted by an experienced MechWarrior.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
