  "StockRole": "Scout",
  "YangsThoughts": "Debuting by Clan Wolf in 3052, the Phantom is a 40 ton Clan Omnimech designed as scout and light mech hunter. A combination of an Endo Steel chassis and a 360-rated XL Engine allow the Phantom to achieve speeds of 151 km/h and maintain 6.5 tons of pod space. The Phantom Prime is armed with an ER Medium Laser and an ER Small Laser. A TAG unit, Active Probe and ECM suite allow it to act as a scout, while an LRM-5 gives it some ranged capabilities.",
